{"title":"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57fe15717b854ffbfb5d8419c4cda90670de0a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4 \\times 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/d/24d2003e2fbf4b93c672fe714f1f42f50f35faab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 0.45 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0.05 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 1.25 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0.20 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 0.02$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"504\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simplify the fraction:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/3/a134bbe5da5834a19327a7a17dc5e460f4286ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4 \\times 5} = \\frac{1}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"93\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>However, the problem wants us to convert this fraction into a decimal. Dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e19c4697dd55656f6c93e36ec31050657a592d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e0832a530ed61d03b748aec6b50c345ed1b938d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 0.05}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat\">2006 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"200